  <TR>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>
    <P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0">Westport Fuel Systems Inc. (&quot;<B>Westport</B>&quot; or the &quot;<B>Corporation</B>&quot;)<BR>
    1691 West 75th Avenue</P>
    <P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0">Vancouver, British Columbia</P>
    <P STYLE="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0">V6P 6P2</P></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Item 2</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Date Of Material Change</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>June 1, 2023</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Item 3</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">News Release</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">A news release dated June 1, 2023 disclosing the material change referred to in this report was disseminated via GlobeNewswire. A copy of the news release has been filed on SEDAR (www.sedar.com) and EDGAR (www.sec.gov) under Westport's issuer profile.&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Item 4</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Summary Of Material Change</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 1.9pt; text-align: justify">On June 1, 2023 Westport completed the previously announced consolidation of its common shares (the &quot;<B>Common Shares</B>&quot;) on the basis of 1 post-consolidation Common Share for every 10 pre-consolidation Common Shares (the &quot;<B>Consolidation</B>&quot;). Westport's Common Shares began trading on a post-Consolidation basis on the TSX and the Nasdaq at the open of markets on June 6, 2023 under the same trading symbol. Immediately prior to the Consolidation, the Corporation had 171,751,409 Common Shares issued and outstanding and, following the Consolidation, there are 17,174,972 Common Shares issued and outstanding. </TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD><B>Item 5</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Full Description Of Material Change</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The full details of the material change that is the subject matter of this report are set forth in the news release attached hereto as Schedule &quot;A&quot;. The news release, including the cautionary notes regarding forward-looking information contained therein, is incorporated by reference into this report. </TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Item 6</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: none">Reliance On Subsection 7.1(2) Of National Instrument 51-102</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>Not applicable.</TD></TR>
  <TR>
